WEBVTT

00:00:45.790 --> 00:00:50.615
Here is the same purple pen in the expert demonstration and the
current episode.

00:00:50.615 --> 00:00:54.940
MXI projects the grasp center into both wrist views.

00:00:54.940 --> 00:00:57.077
Now watch the left hand approach.

00:00:57.077 --> 00:00:59.302
The pen moves toward the cross.

00:00:59.302 --> 00:01:02.902
The fingers close, and the pen rises with the hand.

00:01:02.902 --> 00:01:08.502
A shared geometric reference helps the policy relate its own grasp to
the demonstration.

00:02:11.060 --> 00:02:15.038
On 22 tasks shared with the original report,

00:02:15.038 --> 00:02:19.830
the category-balanced score rose from 52.27 to 80.58.
